        "subject": "Last one from me",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "={{ $json.first_name }} — last note, I promise.\n\nIf DM volume isn't a problem for you, totally fine — skip this. But if you've had even one \"oh shit, missed that DM\" moment in the last month, that's what I'm solving.\n\nFree 90-day pilot. 20 min to decide.\n\n{{ $env.CALENDLY_LINK }}\n\n— {{ $env.SENDER_NAME || 'Anshu' }}",
        "options": {}
